      "writtenOn": "2023-03-15T10:45:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we want to use the public API, another problem is:\n\nShould we import the \"ScopedOpenSSL\"? so we would not need to \"free\" the objects manually before every return statement.\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/libchrome/crypto/scoped_openssl_types.h",
      "parentUuid": "6128c3bc_8e2acd61",
      "range": {
